 "title": "Online Payment | Franklin County",
 "text": "Online Payment | Franklin County\n-->\nSkip to main content\nopens in new tab or window\nTREASURER’S OFFICE UPDATES\nPursuant to Ohio Revised Code 7.16 (B.3), Franklin County 2025 Property Tax Rates for 2026 are posted in their entirety on The Columbus Dispatch website.\nAny taxes paid after July 20, 2026, will accrue a penalty and interest. Failure to receive a tax bill will not avoid such penalty and interest.\nTaxpayers who have not received a bill should call 614-525-3438.\nPlease click here to view (PNG, 1MB)\nQuick Links:\nQuick Links\nContact Us\nFacebook\nInstagram\nX\nMenu\nSearch\nPayments\nTop Tasks\nPay Online\nOnline Payment\nPayment Credit Timeline\nBy Mail\nPay In Person\nOverpayments\nAbout Taxes\nQuick Links\nProperty Tax Search\nCollection Dates\nProperty Tax Due Date FAQ\nTax Estimator\nUnderstanding Your Tax Bill\nReal Estate Taxes\nManufactured Homes\nTax Rates\nTax Savings\nOwner Occupied Reduction\nHomestead Exemption\nDelinquent Taxes\nBankruptcy\nForeclosure\nRequest for Penalty Forgiveness\nTax Lien Sale\nTax Payer Information\nBuyer Information\nInvestments\nInvestment Advisory Meetings\nInvestment Policy\nEthics Policy\nForeclosures Land Bank\nForeclosure Resources\nForeclosure Timeline\nLand Bank Program\nSteps for Homeowners\nForeclosure Tips\nHow to Prevent Home Foreclosure\nWhat to Do When Facing Home Foreclosure\nAbout\nFAQs\nContact Us\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Use\nProperty Tax Search\nSelect the Escape key to close the menu. Focus will then be set to the first menu item.\nHome\n/\nPayments / Online Payment\nIn This Section\nOnline Payment\nPayment Credit Timeline\nBy Mail\nPay In Person\nOverpayments\nOnline Payment\nPay your taxes by credit card, debit card, or eCheck, using the following link.\nPay Taxes Online\nYour payment will be considered accepted and paid on the submitted date; however it may take 3-5 business days for processing.\nHow to Make a Payment\nLocate Your Property\nSearch for your property using your parcel number, owner name, or address.\nYou will receive a comprehensive overview of your parcel information, including any outstanding balances and the most recent property tax bill.\nPayment Options\nPayments can be made as a guest or by creating a registered account. Creating a registered account is not required, but creating an account allows you to:\nRetain payment and property information for future use.\nAccess receipts and transaction history.\nSchedule payments for a future date.\nOnline payments can be made with the following methods:\nCredit Card (Visa, MasterCard, Discover, American Express)\nDebit Card\nElectronic Check (eCheck)/ACH (Automated Clearing House)\nProcessing Fees\nA processing fee applies to credit and debit card transactions, collected by the Treasurer's Office payment processor, Point & Pay. These fees do not go to Franklin County.\nCredit card processing fee: 2.19% of the total transaction or a minimum of $1.50.\nDebit card processing fee: 0.85% of the total transaction or a minimum of $1.50.\nThere is no processing fee for electronic check.\nThere is no processing fee for an ACH payment.\nPayment Voiding and Refunds\nOnline payments can be voided by calling (614) 525-3438 until 5:00 PM on the same business day they occur.\nRefunds for transactions after the 5:00 PM deadline are processed through the Franklin County Treasurer's Refund process according to applicable Ohio Revised Code (ORC) sections.\nCall 614-525-3438 to request an Application for Refund form.\nComplete the for and submit the notarized application and proof of payment to the Treasurer's Office. Allow 6-8 weeks for processing and issuance of your refund.\nAdditional Information\nOnline Payment Portal User Guide (PDF, 630KB)\nContact Us\nContact Our Office\nCustomer Service\n614-525-3438\nBack to top\nSite Footer\nSite Footer\nContact Us\n373 S. High St., 17th Floor\nColumbus, OH 43215-6306\nView on Map\nT: 614-525-3438\nE: treasurer@franklincountyohio.gov\nSite Footer\nShare & Connect\nLike us on Facebook\nFollow us on X\nFollow us on Instagram\nAccessibility Statement | Sitemap\n© 2026 Franklin County | Powered by Granicus\nClose ×",
